{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00929","headline":"横吹曲辞 出塞 · 陈子昂","name":"横吹曲辞 出塞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽闻天上将，关塞重横行。\n始返楼兰国，还向朔方城。\n黄金装战马，白羽集神兵。\n星月开天阵，山川列地营。\n晚风吹画角，春色耀飞旌。\n宁知班定远，独是一书生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}